<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon starts USA Waste.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon starts USA Waste.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said analyst P.J. Juvekar initiated coverage of three companies in the solid waste industry.</p>
<p>-- put a strong buy on USA Waste Services Inc.</p>
<p>-- put buy ratings on Browning-Ferris Industries Inc and Waste Management Inc.</p>
<p>-- Shares of USA Waste Services Inc were trading up 3/4 at 38-1/2, Browning-Ferris shares were up 1/4 at 34-7/8 and Waste Management shares rose one to 33-1/16.</p>
</text>
